## 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email" : "test@test.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "nickname":"테스트"
}

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "newpassword123"
}

### 정보조회
@access_token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwicm9sZSI6IlJPTEVfVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc5MDA0NDU3NCwiZXhwIjoxNzkwMDQ1NDc0fQ.feNU4wI9UL6aU5jl_ZJIeCdeMdrbeWR4ThPWSGOl_f8wiP0I7L1MOKV70RfZV6Mf
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/info
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### 닉네임 수정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/update/name
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname" : "홍길동"
}

### 비밀번호 변경
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/update/password
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "test1234",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### 회원탈퇴
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/info
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}